            "review_title": "Review at Thien Ly Traditional Clay Pot Rice - Ham Nghi",
            "review_text": "Trail48992056844\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nBad experience\nOct 2026 • Family\nDelicious food and cute staff. But my wife fell, I feel the experience got worse. The restroom area is hot, has an odor, and the flush button is broken. My wife fell on the stairs and said to the staff to check it again. When going to the bathroom with my mother, I have to tell my mother to be careful. Maybe because I spoke a little too loudly, a male staff member helped lead my mother. Hope the restaurant changes its facilities to avoid such unfortunate incidents happening again. Spent money to eat and brought sickness home\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten October 4, 2026",
