            "review_title": "Review at Thien Ly Traditional Clay Pot Rice - Ham Nghi",
            "review_text": "FunTravel\n26 contributions\n0\nExperience at Cơm Niêu Thiên Lý (Hàm Nghi Branch)\nNov 2025 • Family\nThe food here is clearly pre-cooked and not even reheated before serving. My braised fish in a clay pot was cold, and the sour soup was just barely warm. I’m really disappointed because this location doesn’t come close to the quality of other Cơm Niêu Thiên Lý branches.\n\nIt seems the only reason they get away with this is because the restaurant is in a busy tourist area — people come and go quickly, and few take the time to review or complain. Unfortunately, the high traffic doesn’t excuse poor food quality or lack of care. Definitely not worth coming back.\nRead more\nWritten November 12, 2025",
